@* A small "Preview" chip for anywhere a Preview-tier feature flag (#1781) surfaces: the Service Settings page's
   "Preview features" card, and any control the feature itself adds once enabled. Tertiary is the design system's
   token reserved for accents outside the Metaverse (primary) / Connected System (secondary) roles
   (engineering/DESIGN.md), which fits a badge that names neither side of a sync. Deliberately Size.Small: a label
   riding beside a switch or a control's own name, not a standalone status chip. *@
<MudChip T="string" Variant="Variant.Text" Color="Color.Tertiary" Size="Size.Small" Class="@Class">Preview</MudChip>

@code {
    /// <summary>
    /// Optional extra CSS classes, appended to the chip's own.
    /// </summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? Class { get; set; }
}
